# Macro Prediction Framework — Honest Audit

**Completed:** 2026-05-24  
**Data:** BLS Public API + Yahoo Finance monthly, 2018–2025  
**Method:** Walk-forward validation (train on t-24 months, predict t+1, roll forward)  
**Audit standard:** Diebold-Mariano / McNemar significance tests on all claims

---

## The Core Question

> Can we predict economic data releases before they happen — and if so, why or why not?

**Short answer: No, not with free data and statistical confidence.**

All four phases show improvements over naive baselines, but none are statistically significant at the 5% or 10% level. The honest answer is that the free data available (BLS + Yahoo Finance monthly) is insufficient to demonstrate a reliable predictive edge.

